      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You're not just fighting for your life, you're fighting for the right to die with some semblance of control. The thought of being dragged away, helpless and humiliated, is almost too much to bear. Meeting your end on your own terms, even if it's just a matter of time, is the only way to ensure that you don't have to face the indignity of defeat. It's a cruel fate, but it's a fate you'd rather choose than be treated like a broken toy.",
      "source": "target",
